<translation id="8390323835464055390">Ngena ngemvume ngamaphasiwedi nezikhiye zakho zokudlula ezilondoloziwe kunoma iyiphi i-app usebenzisa iVortex Ezigcwaliselayo</translation>
<translation id="8409374867500149834">Unokuvikeleka okuqine kakhulu kwe-Vortex ngokumelene namawebhusayithi ayingozi</translation>
<translation id="8543509361021925846">{THRESHOLD,plural, =1{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho iVortex ingasetshenziswa umzuzu ongu-{THRESHOLD}. Idatha elondolozwe kule divayisi kuphela ngenkathi ungene ngemvume izosulwa. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando namaphasiwedi.}one{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho iVortex ingasetshenziswa imizuzu engu-{THRESHOLD}. Idatha elondolozwe kule divayisi kuphela ngenkathi ungene ngemvume izosulwa. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando namaphasiwedi.}other{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho iVortex ingasetshenziswa imizuzu engu-{THRESHOLD}. Idatha elondolozwe kule divayisi kuphela ngenkathi ungene ngemvume izosulwa. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando namaphasiwedi.}}</translation>
<translation id="8586442755830160949">Copyright <ph name="YEAR" /> Ababhali be-Vortex. Wonke amalungelo agciniwe.</translation>
<translation id="8602103377623855616">Ikhasi leVortex</translation>
<translation id="865600487977764604">Kukugcina uphephile ku-Vortex futhi kungase kusetshenziswe ukuthuthukisa ukuvikeleka kwakho kwamanye ama-app we-Google lapho ungene ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="8663480472502753423">Gcina i-Vortex isesikhathini</translation>
<translation id="8685813584220679697">Ngena ngemvume kuleli sayithi naku-Vortex.</translation>
<translation id="8698780336333802489">Ngenisa kuVortex</translation>
<translation id="8730503818204408000">Vuma Amasethingi e-Vortex ukuze usethe i-Vortex Njengebhrawuza Ezenzakalelayo.</translation>
<translation id="8754966941001340678">I-Vortex incoma ukuvikelwa okuthuthukisiwe</translation>
<translation id="8759037115129007407">Ilungu lakho lomndeni alikwazi ukwamukela amaphasiwedi khona manje. Licele libuyekeze i-Vortex futhi livumelanise amaphasiwedi alo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="8769418653786388149">Hamba neVortex yakho</translation>
<translation id="8776843108004031667">Le akhawunti kanye nanoma iyiphi idatha engalondolozwanga izosuswa ku-Vortex.</translation>
<translation id="8793333988063379360">Ungathola amasethingi eVortex nokuningi lapha</translation>
<translation id="8805148242934787134">Setha iVortex njengebhrawuza evuleka ngokuzenzekela</translation>
<translation id="8826789549860004832">Thola okuningi kuVortex ngokuqhubeka nokusetha ibhrawuza yakho.</translation>
<translation id="88376265765385899">Ivula amabhukhimakhi e-Vortex.</translation>
