<translation id="8880024619507699923">Inhlangano yakho idinga ukuba ungene ngemvume ukuze usebenzise iVortex. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="8900052431807804054">Thola Ukuvikeleka Okuqine Kakhulu KweVortex</translation>
<translation id="8908791447256515663">Finyelela iVortex ngokushesha kuDokhi ye-iPad yakho.</translation>
<translation id="8925569192291721236">Hlala unolwazi ngezibuyekezo zokulandelela intengo namathiphu eVortex.</translation>
<translation id="8950326149985259075">{THRESHOLD,plural, =1{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho i-Vortex ingasetshenziswa umzuzu ongu-{THRESHOLD}}one{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho i-Vortex ingasetshenziswa imizuzu engu-{THRESHOLD}}other{Lokhu kwenzeka lapho i-Vortex ingasetshenziswa imizuzu engu-{THRESHOLD}}}</translation>
<translation id="8963279154877372067">Vumela izaziso ze-Vortex ukuthola izexwayiso zokwehla kwentengo</translation>
<translation id="8975812008711371178">Sesha ngezwi kuVortex</translation>
<translation id="900560297598578021">Ungene ngemvume njengo-<ph name="EMAIL" />.

Idatha yakho ibethelwe ngomushwana wakho wokungena ngo-<ph name="TIME" />. Ifake ukuze usebenzise futhi wonge idatha ye-Vortex ku-Google Account yakho.</translation>
<translation id="9022552996538154597">Ngena ngemvume ku-Vortex</translation>
<translation id="9031260906956926157">Enye idatha yakho yeVortex ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account.
Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha izosulwa.</translation>
<translation id="9050790730841755540">Sebenzisa i-Vortex noma nini uma uthepha amalinki kwamanye ama-app.</translation>
<translation id="9059693977935746710">Ngeke kudingeke ukuthi ukhumbule le phasiwedi. Izolondolozwa Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi se-<ph name="EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="9089354809943900324">I-Vortex ayikho kudethi</translation>
<translation id="9105645282262300612">Ithiphu yeVortex: Sesha lokho okubonayo</translation>
<translation id="9152995302810511799">Ithiphu yeVortex: Thola ukuvikeleka okuqine kakhulu kweVortex</translation>
<translation id="9177628952266852500"><ph name="EMAIL" />. IVortex iphethwe.</translation>
<translation id="921174536258924340">I-Vortex ayikwazanga ukuhlola wonke amaphasiwedi. Zama futhi kusasa noma <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />hlola amaphasiwedi ku-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="924957577793602335">Yenza i-Vortex Ibe ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="981812233959540767">Dlala iGeyimu ye-Dino ye-Vortex</translation>
<translation id="985602178874221306">Ababhali be-Vortex</translation>
</translationbundle>